<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', position: 'relative' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 80, top: 44, right: 80 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1565C0', letterSpacing: 2 }}>04 总体设计</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', marginTop: 6 }}>六层架构：单向主链，禁止跨层</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#1565C0', marginTop: 10 }} />
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 80, top: 150, width: 360, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
      自上而下六层：交互层只做<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1565C0' }}>听懂与追问</span>，
      契约层是唯一的<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1565C0' }}>写入口</span>，
      生成层不持有参数，求解层不理解业务，验证层只读不改，回流层不做技术判断。
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
      这样分层的目的是<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>把不确定性锁在一层内</span>：语言理解最不确定，下游全部确定性，失败时一眼能定位是哪一层的问题。
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ background: '#F1F5F9', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 18px', borderLeft: '4px solid #00897B' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#00695C', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        契约哈希 = 模型指纹：留下契约就能完整重建模型，不依赖任何中间产物
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <svg width='740' height='500' viewBox='0 0 740 500' style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 70, top: 140 }}>
    <defs>
      <marker id='ar2' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='8' refY='5' markerWidth='6' markerHeight='6' orient='auto-start-reverse'>
        <path d='M2 1L8 5L2 9' fill='none' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='1.5' />
      </marker>
    </defs>
    {[
      { t: 'L1 交互层', s: '意图 · 槽位 · 追问 · 越界拒绝', o: 'Intent', f: '#1565C0' },
      { t: 'L2 契约层', s: '规范化 · 三层校验 · 契约指纹', o: 'FEASpec', f: '#1E6FC2' },
      { t: 'L3 生成层', s: '建面打标 · 全四边形网格 · 双方言写卡', o: '几何/网格/输入卡', f: '#2779C4' },
      { t: 'L4 求解层', s: '串行调度 · 结果归一（同网格同契约）', o: '归一化结果', f: '#3082C6' },
      { t: 'L5 验证层', s: '九道闸：网格/语义/平衡/双码/解析解/退化/指纹/回归/自洽', o: '验证报告', f: '#398BC8' },
      { t: 'L6 应用回流层', s: '交付 · 失败样本回流 · 能力统计', o: '交付物/样本', f: '#00897B' },
    ].map((L, i) => (
      <g key={i}>
        <rect x='10' y={10 + i * 78} width='530' height='62' rx='8' fill={L.f} />
        <text x='30' y={36 + i * 78} fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold' fill='#FFFFFF' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>{L.t}</text>
        <text x='30' y={58 + i * 78} fontSize='11.5' fill='rgba(255,255,255,0.88)' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>{L.s}</text>
        <text x='556' y={46 + i * 78} fontSize='11.5' fill='#64748B' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>→ {L.o}</text>
        {i < 5 && <line x1='275' y1={72 + i * 78} x2='275' y2={88 + i * 78} stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='1.5' markerEnd='url(#ar2)' />}
      </g>
    ))}
    <line x1='0' y1='12' x2='0' y2='470' stroke='#00897B' strokeWidth='2.5' />
  </svg>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 80, bottom: 24, right: 80, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8' }}>技术框架设计报告</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>07 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
